Package: openmediavault-veracrypt
Architecture: all
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.0), ${misc:Depends}
Description: VeraCrypt mounting and management plugin for OpenMediaVault
 This plugin enables OpenMediaVault users to mount and unmount VeraCrypt
 file containers or partition drives directly from the WebUI.
 It includes configuration profiles, a Drive vs File mount toggle,
 dynamic installation/removal of VeraCrypt, and helpful guidance.
